---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, AUTHOR } from '../consts';

const now = [
	{ en: 'Deep-diving <b>ComfyUI</b> workflow — graph thinking vs prompt engineering.', cjk: '节点图思维 vs prompt 工程' },
	{ en: 'Reading on <b>diffusion fundamentals</b> — from DDPM to flow matching.', cjk: 'DDPM → Flow Matching' },
	{ en: "Building a small tool that feeds <b>Figma frames</b> to SD for variations.", cjk: 'Figma → SD 变体小工具' },
];
---

<BaseLayout title={`About · ${SITE_TITLE}`} description={`About ${AUTHOR.name} — ${AUTHOR.role}`}>

	<section class="pagehead">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="crumbs">№ 03 <span class="arr">/</span> <b>About</b></div>
			<h1>About.</h1>
			<p class="sub">
				A frontend engineer, learning to draw with weights and graphs.
				<span class="cjk">把工作流延伸到 AI 视觉设计。</span>
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="about-body">
		<aside>
			<h5>// quick facts</h5>
			<ul>
				<li><b>NAME</b>{AUTHOR.name}</li>
				<li><b>HANDLE</b>{AUTHOR.handle}</li>
				<li><b>BASED</b>{AUTHOR.city}</li>
				<li><b>TZ</b>{AUTHOR.tz}</li>
				<li><b>ROLE</b>Frontend × Visual</li>
				<li><b>EST</b>2026</li>
			</ul>
			<h5>// channels</h5>
			<ul>
				<li><b>EMAIL</b>{AUTHOR.email}</li>
				<li><b>GITHUB</b>/AxtonCT</li>
				<li><b>TWITTER</b>@AxtonCT</li>
				<li><b>RSS</b>/rss.xml</li>
			</ul>
		</aside>

		<article>
			<p>一个前端工程师，正在把工作流延伸到 AI 视觉设计。</p>
			<p><code>React</code> / <code>Next.js</code> 与 <code>Vue</code> / <code>Nuxt</code> 是日常；<code>Midjourney</code>、<code>ComfyUI</code>、<code>Stable Diffusion</code> 是业余时间想搞清楚的事。</p>
			<p>这里是这条路上沉淀下来的笔记 — <b>不追新闻、不堆 todo、不做教程</b>，只写过半年回头看仍然觉得有用的东西。</p>

			<h2>Now</h2>
			<p>目前正在专注的事情，不定期更新（启发自 <a class="underline" href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener">/now movement</a>）：</p>
			<ul>
				{now.map((n) => (
					<li><Fragment set:html={n.en} /></li>
				))}
			</ul>

			<h2>Reach</h2>
			<p>邮件最稳：<code>{AUTHOR.email}</code>。其他渠道在左侧 — 我看到都会回，只是不一定快。</p>

			<h2>Colophon</h2>
			<p>这个站用 <code>Astro</code> + 静态 markdown 构建，部署在 <code>GitHub Pages</code>。字体是 <b>Bricolage Grotesque</b>（display）+ <b>Atkinson Hyperlegible</b>（prose）+ <b>JetBrains Mono</b>（metadata）。色板：单一灰阶。</p>

			<h2>What this isn't</h2>
			<p>不是教程站。不是新闻站。不是 AI 速通站。这里只是一个工程师的思考留痕。</p>
		</article>
	</section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.cjk { font-family: var(--font-prose); font-style: italic; color: var(--ink); }

	.about-body {
		max-width: var(--container);
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 60px 32px 120px;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
		gap: 80px;
		align-items: start;
	}
	aside {
		position: sticky;
		top: 120px;
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 11px;
		color: var(--ink-mid);
		letter-spacing: .04em;
	}
	aside h5 {
		font-size: 10px;
		color: var(--ink-mid);
		letter-spacing: .14em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		margin: 0 0 12px;
		font-weight: 400;
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
	}
	aside ul { list-style: none; margin: 0 0 28px; padding: 0; }
	aside li {
		padding: 5px 0;
		color: var(--ink);
		font-size: 12px;
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		letter-spacing: .02em;
	}
	aside li b {
		color: var(--ink-mid);
		font-weight: 400;
		margin-right: 8px;
		font-size: 10px;
	}

	article {
		font-family: var(--font-prose);
		font-size: 18px;
		line-height: 1.75;
		color: var(--ink-dim);
		max-width: 680px;
		text-wrap: pretty;
	}
	article > p:first-child {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 26px;
		line-height: 1.35;
		color: var(--ink);
		font-weight: 400;
		letter-spacing: -.015em;
		margin: 0 0 36px;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}
	article p { margin: 0 0 22px; }
	article b, article strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; }
	article code {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: .86em;
		background: var(--bg-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--hair);
		padding: 1px 7px;
		color: var(--ink);
	}
	article h2 {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 13px;
		color: var(--ink-mid);
		letter-spacing: .14em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		margin: 50px 0 18px;
		font-weight: 500;
	}
	article h2::before { content: "— "; color: var(--ink-mid); }
	article ul {
		padding-left: 0;
		list-style: none;
		margin: 0 0 22px;
	}
	article li {
		padding: 10px 0;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--hair);
		color: var(--ink);
		font-family: var(--font-prose);
		font-size: 16px;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}
	article li:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair); }

	@media (max-width: 920px) {
		.about-body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; padding: 40px 22px 80px; }
		aside { position: static; }
		article { font-size: 16px; max-width: none; }
		article > p:first-child { font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
		article h2 { margin: 36px 0 12px; }
		article li { font-size: 15px; }
	}
</style>
